{
  "abstract": "For a four-point support in Z/nZ with n positive and its full labelled ordered square supplied, at most two fixed labelled coefficients of the ordered cube separate the complete four-point square fibre. Coefficient responses are exact integer values embedded in the reals; they are not binary answers. No query lower bound or runtime claim is asserted.",
